` surface is corroborated only by help-text documentation, which current field reports contradict for that exact command.","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"ff792e6539abd05bc","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach 2, '--body accepts ADF, and fit BEFORE encode (Cloud, load-bearing)'","norm_id":"nf71eb1291a54f641","priority":0.0,"reason":"default-advisory","recalled":false,"scenarios":["rich_text_cutover flips to 'cloud': outbound comments are sent as `--body json.dumps(to_wire(fitted))`; if acli stores the JSON as literal text, mirrored comments display raw ADF JSON to users rather than rendered rich text."],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":1.0,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"yes","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"yes","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"yes","path_reachable":"yes","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"yes"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"module","debt_impact":"medium","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none","internal_conflict":"none","irreversible_without_rationale":"none","likelihood":"medium","prod_impact":"medium","reversibility":"moderate","silent_vs_self_revealing":"silent","undecomposed":"none","vague_directive":"none"}}},{"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Define a RETIRE/cleanup path (or an explicit rationale for unbounded retention) for the local_comment_key→Jira-comment-ID map — e.g. drop entries when the owning binding/issue is removed.","cohort":["COH","E1","E2","E6","F1","T2","T4","T5b","T5d","T5e","T6","T9"],"criteria":["T9"],"decision":"dropped","decision_margin":-0.95,"drop_reason":null,"evidence":["\"Persist a local_comment_key (HLC) → Jira comment ID map in binding state\"","\"The map is change-gated, one fixed-shape entry per comment.\"","ABSENCE: lifecycle covers create/update/consume but no retirement — no bullet or AC addresses pruning entries when a binding/issue is removed"],"finding":"The persistent local_comment_key→Jira-comment-ID map is append-only and grows monotonically with every comment ever synced, but the plan defines no RETIRE/cleanup path for map entries (e.g. when a binding is deleted, an issue is unlinked, or a comment is deleted upstream).","group_criteria":null,"group_id":null,"id":"fc7a7507b4a9ac42c","impact":0.0,"is_primary":null,"location":"Approach 1 / binding_store.py scope bullet","norm_id":"nbc332e5be9d9c7db","priority":0.0,"reason":"low-validity","recalled":false,"scenarios":["Long-lived binding accumulates thousands of comment-ID entries; state file grows unbounded","A binding is torn down but its comment-ID map entries persist as orphaned state"],"severity":"none","suggested_fix":"Add a scope note stating map entries are pruned when the binding is retired (or document that per-comment entries are intentionally retained for the binding's lifetime and bounded by comment count).","tier":"LLM","validity":0.25,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","current_state_satisfies_plan_goal":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"no","impact_follows_necessarily":"no","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"no","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"no","path_reachable":"no","prerequisite_attribution_valid":"na","respects_artifact_altitude":"yes","severity_claim_justified":"no"},"severity_attributes":{"ac_unverifiable":"none","blast_radius":"local","debt_impact":"low","divergent_implementation":"none","dod_uncertifiable":"none"